flowchart TD
    A[Raw Incident Data\n timestamp, lat, lng, type, severity] --> B[Feature Engineering Script]
    B --> C[Model-Ready Dataset\n 8 input features + danger_score]

    C --> D[Train MLP Model\n Dense 32 -> Dense 16 -> Output 1]
    D --> E[Export as TFLite]

    E --> F[Flutter App Loads TFLite]
    F --> G[Collect Live Inputs\n time + location + context]
    G --> H[Run Inference]
    H --> I[Danger Score 0 to 10]

    I --> J[Show Risk Level + Safety Suggestions]
    H --> K[If model fails -> Rule-Based Fallback]
